{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14107301","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107301","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730001:":{"text":"喝下吧，这地表清澈的泉水……","source_cn":"喝下吧，这地表清澈的泉水……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86B20E0CF131DED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730002:":{"text":"啊啊啊！我的喉咙……","source_cn":"啊啊啊！我的喉咙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B6FA28D5430595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730003:":{"text":"不！我的内脏……","source_cn":"不！我的内脏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x414CF43E4887E349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730202:":{"text":"啊……啊！","source_cn":"啊……啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA642BEC7E7DB34E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730201:":{"text":"女王……感谢您的恩典！","source_cn":"女王……感谢您的恩典！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C984067D0E4DB0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410730101:0":{"text":"看到了吗？这就是弥萨忒的诅咒。","source_cn":"看到了吗？这就是弥萨忒的诅咒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA3FCC9717B377FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410730102:0":{"text":"多么讽刺啊……地表的清水，这世间最普通的恩赐，却是我族的孽化之源。","source_cn":"多么讽刺啊……地表的清水，这世间最普通的恩赐，却是我族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D6F4FA7643FF4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410730103:0":{"text":"一开始是剧痛，随后是疯狂，最后……沦为失去理智的怪物。","source_cn":"一开始是剧痛，随后是疯狂，最后……沦为失去理智的怪物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E7E014FC6163AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410730104:0":{"text":"两千年前，我带领着最骁勇的绿裔战士们离开故土，可最终……能活着踏入萨洛克兰的，十不足一。","source_cn":"两千年前，我带领着最骁勇的绿裔战士们离开故土，可最终…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C0816C9596D90C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410730105:0":{"text":"命运此时却再度眷顾了我们，我找到了龙，准确地说，是沉睡中的初始之龙。","source_cn":"命运此时却再度眷顾了我们，我找到了龙，准确地说，是沉睡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6EC876BA876FAD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410730106:0":{"text":"我不知道它为何在此沉睡，但我希望它永远不要醒来。","source_cn":"我不知道它为何在此沉睡，但我希望它永远不要醒来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49B80FB2DA55ED88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410730107:0":{"text":"因为龙之力足以与神明相抗，利用初始之龙，艾塞勒将再也不必忍受弥萨忒的诅咒！","source_cn":"因为龙之力足以与神明相抗，利用初始之龙，艾塞勒将再也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB55799ECD22DD0A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410730108:0":{"text":"但初始之龙的力量太过强大，难以驾驭。我不得不退而求其次，尝试控制龙蛋中蕴含的魔法与生命力。","source_cn":"但初始之龙的力量太过强大，难以驾驭。我不得不退而求其次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278D98AB7DE2B656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410730109:0":{"text":"经过千百次的失败，我成功了。恩典灵露，终于诞生了。","source_cn":"经过千百次的失败，我成功了。恩典灵露，终于诞生了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C416A16CA7535D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410730110:0":{"text":"你们以为我在夸耀自己的功绩吗？不——","source_cn":"你们以为我在夸耀自己的功绩吗？不——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC37EFACE0C6B671B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410730111:0":{"text":"恩典灵露是我亲手酿造的救赎。不靠神明，而是我——","source_cn":"恩典灵露是我亲手酿造的救赎。不靠神明，而是我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCDD4B834494392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410730112:0":{"text":"赐予了艾塞勒一族的新生！","source_cn":"赐予了艾塞勒一族的新生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA9B8777F9A80A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410730113:0":{"text":"此刻，就让你们亲眼见证恩典的力量。","source_cn":"此刻，就让你们亲眼见证恩典的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBEF9A385096FFE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410730114:0":{"text":"给这一位灵露。而另一位，就让他向诸位展示——","source_cn":"给这一位灵露。而另一位，就让他向诸位展示——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AC97E5039DCA184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410730115:0":{"text":"被恩典抛弃的下场。","source_cn":"被恩典抛弃的下场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C658B1E1C482477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:21:1410730001:":{"text":"喝下吧，这地表清澈的泉水……","source_cn":"喝下吧，这地表清澈的泉水……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86B20E0CF131DED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_sta